ame": "011.RS_D+_Screenshot_03.png", "id": "1062786108591961", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830890_1062786111925294_6820825958812217735_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d4wTxxNlZs8Q7kNvwG-FPEc&_nc_oc=AdkzYS8BHjXDZjWXsraqWjyj8bS3RYXycnuMDjUU-8-RvCh0-juxn3eXdS3qG5VkNQU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftzscg48548qVPJCJFCsOm-UvcO_KD-QI0p-y7Fr05UpA&oe=69A04A2D"}, {"file_name": "012.RS_D+_Screenshot_04.png", "id": "1888807391681363", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308589_1888807395014696_660138509703032651_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jw2J6wlJbLMQ7kNvwFYTSvs&_nc_oc=Adk9nsT9gLRQ8UGGmWDB6zZsfhiyXAjGVpFbJICNXsHNtf4EzSwxvKA5fGXglMJzmx0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftXNDuRJfz_nbiKkZ34OAkPEPCV37YU1D4PdMa6vNoHCg&oe=69A058BA"}, {"file_name": "009.RS_D+_Screenshot_01.png", "id": "4068036953513638", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292867_4068036956846971_624713770870370506_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VMnAQglJN5YQ7kNvwG-kWTD&_nc_oc=AdnayH_6sLwC_fubyaAx61OYNlzItJeEgB0AOU7uVqHFUZcShQpOjVFBR1ckgRsfcms&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftgWlz7G_FLYv4so3OReSZBrqe3oVev4kN6HqzgkC-7Hw&oe=69A03FA1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RS-Dental+", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Important: More content is available with institutional registration.\n\nRSD+ is a VR-based simulator for dental radiographic diagnosis and practice, providing students with a realistic environment to train in radiography procedures without exposure to radiation.\n\nThrough various scenario-based simulations, learners can train in patient interaction, chart review, clinical assessment, X-ray equipment handling, film positioning, and post-exam image review.\n\n With VRAD's patented medical image processing algorithm, X-ray images are dynamically generated based